@trendifest/opendesk
====================

This package contains source-derived UI code from the OpenDesk web application.

  Upstream:  https://github.com/useopendesk/opendesk
  Commit:    9f7e79072bb41c8be2bd0a96eaa74aba1333ce3c
  License:   Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE in this directory)
  Copyright: Copyright 2026 Mindroot Ltd

Upstream files adapted (paths relative to the upstream repository):

  web/src/styles/app.css            semantic light/dark tokens, base styles, utilities
  web/src/app/AppLayout.tsx         shell frame, inset work panel, collapsed nav rail
  web/src/app/Sidebar.tsx           full-height sidebar, scroll area, stable footer
  web/src/app/sidebarParts.tsx      navigation row shapes, labels, counts, section headers
  web/src/components/ui/button.tsx  Button
  web/src/components/ui/badge.tsx   Badge
  web/src/components/ui/dialog.tsx  Dialog
  web/src/components/ui/spinner.tsx Spinner
  web/src/lib/cn.ts                 class merge helper
  web/src/lib/tones.ts              palette tone names
  LICENSE                           copied verbatim

Adaptations: the helpdesk application runtime (routing, session, i18n, realtime,
assistant, billing, telemetry), its domain components and its scripts were not
copied. Remaining components take their state from props. Motion is limited to
short CSS transitions/animations that are disabled by prefers-reduced-motion,
and Radix supplies dialog focus trapping, Escape handling and ARIA semantics.

Changes made to the derived files are licensed under the Apache License 2.0 as
part of this repository.
